    "summary": "All three nodes are currently unsupported because they lack either an applicable procedural requirement or explicit evidence linking observed conditions to formal statuses. The shift logs record events but do not establish whether those events satisfy a specific work-stage prerequisite (e.g., LOTO rule, authorization step) nor confirm that the 'air-low' label corresponds to a defined alarm threshold.",
